                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4dc48bf7-4f5a-42bb-a4fd-53196a756498">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CONFIGURATION_ERR</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">
                                    Configuration errors, like resources overflow, bad commands flow, bad command parameters, invalid indexes or any other errors caused by bad usage or a malicious host.
                                    Default set is 'IGNORE', because the same error codes are sent to host through shared memory area of each command.
                                    </L-2>
                      </DESC>
