                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIdType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">
                                            CAN065_Conf. Specifies whether the IdValue is of type
                                                - standard identifier (ID - 11 bits length)
                                                - extended identifier (ID - 29 bits length)
                                                - mixed mode (standard or extended)
                                        </L-2>
                      </DESC>
